  },
  "description": "Draft one inline comment on a pull request you were asked to review, for the operator to keep, edit or drop before they submit the review. Call it once per finding or question instead of posting with gh; nothing reaches GitHub until the operator submits. The pull request must have an open review ask on the board, and the line must be part of its diff.",
